sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Gateway
    participant AuthService
    participant UserService
    participant Database
    participant Cache

    User->>Frontend: Login Request
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /api/login
    Gateway->>AuthService: Validate Credentials
    AuthService->>Cache: Check Session Cache

    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>AuthService: Session Data
    else Cache Miss
        AuthService->>Database: Query User
        Database-->>AuthService: User Data
        AuthService->>Cache: Store Session
    end

    AuthService-->>Gateway: JWT Token
    Gateway-->>Frontend: Token + User Info
    Frontend-->>User: Login Success

    Note over User,Frontend: Authenticated Requests

    User->>Frontend: Get Profile
    Frontend->>Gateway: GET /api/profile (Bearer Token)
    Gateway->>AuthService: Validate Token
    AuthService-->>Gateway: Token Valid
    Gateway->>UserService: Get Profile
    UserService->>Cache: Check Profile Cache
    Cache-->>UserService: Profile Data
    UserService-->>Gateway: Profile
    Gateway-->>Frontend: Profile Data
    Frontend-->>User: Display Profile
